{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Together.</b> It is a unique word in Scripture in grammatical analysis, because of the addition of the vav. Yefet said: like a single person alone — there will be no change in meaning." "And he mentioned וישב, and there is no need to mention ויעל, for Scripture took a concise path."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {0 "Resolved the epithet 'Yefet' as the Karaite exegete Yefet ben Eli, a standard interlocutor in Ibn Ezra."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:51.616716196Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}